{"version":1,"content":"<p>大家很容易忘記，就在不久前，塞爾達系列固化的玩法還讓粉絲倍感乏味：《黃昏公主》常被批評過度照搬《時之笛》的套路，《御天之劍》雖説收穫媒體好評，卻也因過度引導玩家的設計飽受詬病。如今這些作品都被玩家奉為經典，但在當時，整個系列確實亟需一場革新。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/game/1586394.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T07:21:27.139068+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":126,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T07:02:18+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T07:14:40.549004+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T07:14:40.549004+00:00","content_hash":"356387671d984e6327492520f196d32cac2a48362c96c852d35c536ecf0adcd6","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}